# Project Structure

- Application routes live in `src/app/`, including localized public routes, non-localized client utilities and API endpoints.
- The homepage is `src/app/[locale]/page.tsx` with `SignalHeroPrototype` and `v2/` components.
- Legacy marketing and customer-card routes are grouped under `src/app/[locale]/(site)/`; route groups do not appear in the URL.
- Dynamic published cards use `/[locale]/c/[slug]`, mapped domains in `middleware.ts`, and Turso operations in `src/lib/db.ts`.
- Supabase onboarding uses `/onboarding/[id]` and `/api/onboarding`.
- Tests live in `tests/`. Static runtime assets in `public/` may be referenced by URL rather than TypeScript imports.
- Preserve data contracts and operational routes during marketing cleanup. No arbitrary file-length rule.
